  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Clank was forged in The Bullies Block, a place where rust never sleeps and neither do the debt collectors. He cut his teeth on scrap metal and broken promises, hustling for every drop of DRIP he could get his flippers on. Now, he reps the Shadow DYOR shirt to remind himself to trust no one and question everything.",
    "class": "Cyberpunk Scavenger",
    "name": "Clank",
    "personality": "Cynical: Clank has seen too much to believe in anything anymore. Resourceful: He can fix anything with a bit of scrap and determination. Introspective: He spends time pondering the meaning of 'facts' in a world made of lies.",
    "specialAbility": {
      "description": "Clank hacks into enemy cryo systems with his Feathercomm Cyber augment, freezing them in place for a short duration. The 'Cyber Quack' stuns robots and ducks alike, providing a critical window for allies to exploit or for Clank to make a quick getaway if things get too hot.",
